WEBVTT

00:00:01.720 --> 00:00:04.890
As a token of my appreciation for your splendid performance,

00:00:04.890 --> 00:00:08.470
I've prepared this final special event for you.

00:00:08.470 --> 00:00:10.590
Is this what that girl was talking about?

00:00:09.340 --> 00:00:13.430
I'll call it "The Great Escape From an Exploding Building!"

00:00:10.590 --> 00:00:12.800
Let's get back to Minato without wasting any time!

00:00:15.430 --> 00:00:16.830
Tsukiumi?!

00:00:18.350 --> 00:00:24.230
Now, if you don't hurry up... you might lose the data along with your life!

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:27.200
Yet another explosion...

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:29.740
We just having to keep climbing up.

00:00:30.640 --> 00:00:32.570
Let's go, Musubi-chan.

00:00:33.030 --> 00:00:33.820
Okay!

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:50.550
So just tracing it won't work, huh?

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:51.720
Then how about... this!

00:00:53.900 --> 00:00:54.930
What in the world is this?

00:00:55.480 --> 00:00:56.850
A hidden program?

00:00:58.930 --> 00:01:00.480
Maa-chan, look out!

00:01:06.030 --> 00:01:08.190
It seems like you guys have started the party already.

00:01:08.630 --> 00:01:10.340
Seo-tan!

00:01:10.340 --> 00:01:11.110
Yo!

00:01:11.510 --> 00:01:12.850
Why are you here...?

00:01:12.850 --> 00:01:13.820
Just doing my job.

00:01:14.570 --> 00:01:19.160
The request this time is to get involved in this mess to gain access to M.B.I.'s secret data,

00:01:16.330 --> 00:01:17.740
You stand back, Shorty.

00:01:19.460 --> 00:01:21.530
and to help you in hacking the server.

00:01:19.990 --> 00:01:22.620
Geez, these things are annoying.

00:01:26.050 --> 00:01:30.290
Apparently, you can break through the security if you use the double-layered passcode from this thing.

00:01:30.290 --> 00:01:33.150
The passcode for M.B.I.'s main server?

00:01:34.120 --> 00:01:35.650
Who's your client?

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:38.860
Higa Izumi.

00:01:39.700 --> 00:01:41.570
You couldn't do it, could you?

00:01:41.570 --> 00:01:43.220
What are you trying to do?

00:01:43.220 --> 00:01:46.100
You don't know what Higa might be planning.

00:01:46.850 --> 00:01:48.110
That's why I'm doing this.

00:01:53.150 --> 00:01:54.570
Minato-san!

00:01:58.250 --> 00:01:59.780
This is nothing...

00:02:00.390 --> 00:02:02.700
Let's go, Musubi-chan!

00:02:03.300 --> 00:02:04.580
We are almost there!

00:02:05.540 --> 00:02:06.370
Yeah!

00:02:14.120 --> 00:02:16.030
Well then, let's start the upload.

00:02:16.030 --> 00:02:17.640
Sure, go for it.

00:02:19.800 --> 00:02:20.970
It's arrived.

00:02:20.970 --> 00:02:23.470
It certainly is from M.B.I.'s main server.

00:02:24.330 --> 00:02:25.990
Seems like it's going well.

00:02:26.520 --> 00:02:30.110
With this, we have all of M.B.I.'s secret technology,

00:02:30.110 --> 00:02:33.530
as well as all the data on Sekirei from Kamikura Island.

00:02:34.340 --> 00:02:38.980
All of the relics that Minaka was ruling over have now fallen into my hands.

00:02:45.840 --> 00:02:47.870
Woah! There goes another one.

00:02:54.440 --> 00:02:56.720
The Guard System has been deactivated.

00:03:00.590 --> 00:03:02.080
Finally...

00:03:02.080 --> 00:03:04.290
Hey, it won't move again, right?

00:03:04.290 --> 00:03:05.310
It'll be all right, won't it?

00:03:05.950 --> 00:03:09.020
All that is left now is to stop the self-destruct mechanism of the tower.

00:03:10.490 --> 00:03:11.790
Wh-What's going on?!

00:03:11.790 --> 00:03:12.320
Seo!

00:03:12.800 --> 00:03:13.730
This doesn't looks good, Matsu.

00:03:14.240 --> 00:03:15.140
It's gas!

00:03:15.140 --> 00:03:18.070
A multi-layered trap activated when they're forcefully shut down.

00:03:18.430 --> 00:03:21.960
That's the President for you.
He's the best when it comes down to ridiculous things.

00:03:21.960 --> 00:03:23.970
This isn't the time to admire him!

00:03:25.080 --> 00:03:27.710
Seo-tan, I'll leave Kusano-tan in your care.

00:03:28.340 --> 00:03:29.450
Maa-chan?

00:03:32.540 --> 00:03:33.410
Hurry up!

00:03:33.410 --> 00:03:36.090
It's not that far away now! We can get there in time!

00:03:37.080 --> 00:03:40.680
No! I want to fight with Maa-chan!

00:03:39.060 --> 00:03:40.680
Hey, stop struggling!

00:03:40.680 --> 00:03:42.070
Is it really all right?

00:03:42.070 --> 00:03:44.470
I'm not sure if she can make it out of there safely...

00:03:45.470 --> 00:03:48.100
She won't go down that easily.

00:03:52.390 --> 00:03:52.940
Oh- Hey!

00:03:54.610 --> 00:03:55.760
Wait up!

00:03:55.760 --> 00:03:56.880
Wait, you idiot!

00:03:56.880 --> 00:03:57.530
Go catch her.

00:04:00.950 --> 00:04:03.750
What the hell is that Shorty thinking?!

00:04:03.750 --> 00:04:04.410
Seo.

00:04:04.900 --> 00:04:09.330
All we can do now is trust Matsu and believe that she'd pull this off...

00:04:28.960 --> 00:04:31.190
15 more explosive devices left...

00:04:31.830 --> 00:04:33.540
If I can deactivate them...

00:04:40.480 --> 00:04:42.570
Kusano-tan?! Why are you...

00:04:42.570 --> 00:04:44.910
I'm going to fight with Maa-chan!

00:04:45.340 --> 00:04:46.640
Kusano-tan...

00:04:53.940 --> 00:04:55.620
It's not over yet...

00:04:58.270 --> 00:04:59.470
Kusano-tan...?

00:05:01.590 --> 00:05:04.620
Now all of the devices have been deactivated.

00:05:12.430 --> 00:05:14.770
T-The Third Stage?!

00:05:16.080 --> 00:05:18.730
Then that means everything was planned...

00:05:19.110 --> 00:05:20.570
...from the beginning...

00:05:20.970 --> 00:05:22.670
Mina-tan...

00:05:27.170 --> 00:05:28.460
What's wrong?

00:05:28.460 --> 00:05:30.060
I felt something... just now...

00:05:36.660 --> 00:05:39.620
Huh? It seems like the explosions have stopped...

00:05:39.620 --> 00:05:42.260
Matsu-san must have deactivated them!

00:05:42.920 --> 00:05:44.970
This is the last staircase.

00:05:44.970 --> 00:05:46.550
Let's go, Minato-san.

00:05:46.550 --> 00:05:47.430
Yeah.

00:06:01.850 --> 00:06:03.950
You are 37 seconds earlier, I see...

00:06:04.500 --> 00:06:05.920
Congratulations.

00:06:06.910 --> 00:06:08.370
Oh, President!

00:06:08.370 --> 00:06:10.670
'Sup, Musubi-kun!

00:06:10.670 --> 00:06:13.580
You are just as energetic as usual!

00:06:13.580 --> 00:06:15.750
Yup, energetic as usual!

00:06:15.750 --> 00:06:17.330
Glad to hear that.

00:06:18.980 --> 00:06:23.470
I knew you would be able to make it here, Sahashi Minato-kun.

00:06:23.470 --> 00:06:25.420
N-Nice to meet you...

00:06:26.530 --> 00:06:28.000
So, about that promise...

00:06:28.000 --> 00:06:29.870
Oh right.

00:06:29.870 --> 00:06:31.810
The promised thing is placed right over there.

00:06:33.090 --> 00:06:35.750
Now, don't hesitate and take it.

00:06:37.910 --> 00:06:39.420
With this...

00:06:40.350 --> 00:06:42.660
Chiho-san's illness can be treated with this, right?

00:06:42.660 --> 00:06:46.460
But of course! There is nothing impossible for M.B.I.!

00:06:46.460 --> 00:06:48.100
Thank goodness...

00:06:48.100 --> 00:06:52.110
But if you linger around, you won't be able to get back home.

00:06:53.100 --> 00:06:57.290
The explosions may have stopped,
but the tower seems to be at its limit right now.

00:06:57.670 --> 00:06:59.320
L-Limit?!

00:06:59.320 --> 00:07:04.130
To tell you the truth, these explosions weren't specifically prepared for this event.

00:07:05.790 --> 00:07:11.760
They were originally there for the purpose of demolishing this tower so it could be reconstructed.

00:07:11.760 --> 00:07:18.370
But how should I put it? I just activated them on a whim since you guys were working so hard.

00:07:20.360 --> 00:07:23.110
Well then, I shall pray for your safe departure.

00:07:25.340 --> 00:07:26.680
H-Hold on-

00:07:32.410 --> 00:07:33.700
Minato-san!

00:07:47.070 --> 00:07:48.920
H-He ran away...

00:07:52.190 --> 00:07:55.480
M-Musubi-chan, we have to get out of here quickly!

00:07:55.480 --> 00:07:56.140
Yes!

00:08:04.940 --> 00:08:07.860
I didn't make this escape pod for nothing.

00:08:07.860 --> 00:08:09.990
I have to use it once, at least.

00:08:09.990 --> 00:08:13.280
And Takami-kun was calling this useless!

00:08:13.790 --> 00:08:15.680
That idiot...

00:08:17.240 --> 00:08:18.900
The Capital Tower has...

00:08:18.900 --> 00:08:20.570
The guys from the North have won.

00:08:20.980 --> 00:08:22.880
We're free!

00:08:23.420 --> 00:08:24.580
Winner!

00:08:25.300 --> 00:08:26.710
So guys...

00:08:27.560 --> 00:08:29.800
Are you really satisfied with this outcome?

00:08:33.760 --> 00:08:37.520
It can't be finished with just <i>that</i>, right?

00:08:40.750 --> 00:08:43.650
With this, the M.B.I. is done for.

00:08:45.320 --> 00:08:46.510
I wonder about that.

00:08:47.860 --> 00:08:50.070
Woah! You must be kidding me!

00:08:50.470 --> 00:08:52.430
I wonder what happened out there...

00:08:52.590 --> 00:08:55.490
I would've come from the start if I knew it'd end up like this.

00:08:55.490 --> 00:08:59.770
Y-Yukari-san, that's just being overly curious...

00:09:00.700 --> 00:09:03.320
If I'm not mistaken, that girl is...

00:09:03.320 --> 00:09:04.830
What's wrong?

00:09:05.380 --> 00:09:07.840
No, it's nothing...

00:09:14.260 --> 00:09:16.890
Minato-san, we're jumping outside.

00:09:47.150 --> 00:09:49.360
Minato-san, are you all right?

00:09:49.990 --> 00:09:51.040
Yeah.

00:09:51.040 --> 00:09:53.370
But I'm glad we survived that.

00:10:00.480 --> 00:10:01.580
What's wrong?

00:10:01.990 --> 00:10:05.610
Well, I have this feeling of déjà vu...

00:10:08.460 --> 00:10:09.380
Tsukiumi?

00:10:10.030 --> 00:10:10.800
Kazehana-san?

00:10:11.440 --> 00:10:12.260
Kagari-san?

00:10:12.740 --> 00:10:13.680
Matsu-san?

00:10:14.120 --> 00:10:15.600
Even Kuu-chan?!

00:10:16.180 --> 00:10:18.060
M-Minato...?

00:10:18.420 --> 00:10:20.500
Tsukiumi-san, you're all right?

00:10:20.500 --> 00:10:21.850
T-Thank goodness!

00:10:21.850 --> 00:10:25.260
No... Don't come near us...!

00:10:34.140 --> 00:10:34.820
Hey.

00:10:35.350 --> 00:10:36.580
Karasuba-sama.

00:10:37.290 --> 00:10:39.820
I've been waiting for you, Muu-chan.

00:10:39.820 --> 00:10:42.290
What's a Disciplinary Squad member doing here?

00:10:42.290 --> 00:10:43.880
Isn't it over already?

00:10:43.880 --> 00:10:46.940
I haven't had my fun yet...

00:10:46.940 --> 00:10:48.550
F-Fun...?

00:10:48.550 --> 00:10:49.620
That's right.

00:10:49.960 --> 00:10:51.590
What do you think, Muu-chan?

00:10:51.590 --> 00:10:53.050
With me?

00:10:53.430 --> 00:10:55.270
That's right, Musubi.

00:10:55.760 --> 00:10:58.180
You will fight me, won't you?

00:10:58.590 --> 00:11:01.540
W-What's the point in fighting now...!

00:11:01.540 --> 00:11:04.320
Do you even need a reason for that?

00:11:05.850 --> 00:11:07.690
If you are not going to be my opponent...

00:11:09.850 --> 00:11:13.030
Then I'll just fight with these girls...

00:11:14.720 --> 00:11:17.340
So Musubi, what's it going to be?

00:11:18.900 --> 00:11:22.250
No. 88, Musubi, accepts your challenge!

00:11:22.250 --> 00:11:23.210
Musubi-chan!

00:12:00.990 --> 00:12:02.490
Musubi! Above you!

00:12:05.040 --> 00:12:07.210
MUSUBI!

00:12:11.530 --> 00:12:13.530
MUSUBI-CHAN!!!

00:12:26.240 --> 00:12:29.770
It really seems like you've become a little stronger, but...

00:12:30.140 --> 00:12:32.180
Is that all you've got?

00:12:32.180 --> 00:12:34.030
How disappointing...

00:12:34.030 --> 00:12:36.340
I'm disappointed, Musubi.

00:12:36.340 --> 00:12:37.650
Mina-tan...

00:12:38.190 --> 00:12:39.140
Matsu-san?

00:12:39.140 --> 00:12:41.830
Take Musubi-tan and run away.

00:12:42.530 --> 00:12:46.660
Musubi-tan cannot win against No.04 in her current state.

00:12:51.000 --> 00:12:52.420
No!

00:12:53.190 --> 00:12:54.630
Stop it...

00:12:54.700 --> 00:12:56.300
Stop it already!

00:12:58.050 --> 00:13:01.080
Stop Minato-san, please get off me!

00:13:01.080 --> 00:13:02.140
I won't!

00:13:02.140 --> 00:13:03.050
Minato-san!

00:13:03.500 --> 00:13:06.820
I decided to protect everyone as well!

00:13:07.290 --> 00:13:09.020
That's why I will never move away!

00:13:09.020 --> 00:13:11.010
Don't do it, Minato-san!

00:13:11.010 --> 00:13:12.380
I see...

00:13:12.380 --> 00:13:13.890
That's right.

00:13:13.890 --> 00:13:18.990
There's a possibility that I might get to see your true power if he dies.

00:13:23.890 --> 00:13:25.410
She intends to cut Sahashi as well?!

00:13:25.830 --> 00:13:26.870
Don't do it!

00:13:27.040 --> 00:13:28.410
Water Celebration!

00:13:31.270 --> 00:13:34.880
I won't let you get a step further!

00:13:35.310 --> 00:13:36.840
Flower Dance!

00:13:41.680 --> 00:13:44.140
You guys are getting in my way.

00:13:45.160 --> 00:13:46.240
It's no use.

00:13:46.240 --> 00:13:47.100
Everyone...!

00:14:05.340 --> 00:14:07.260
Trust your bonds.

00:14:08.330 --> 00:14:09.120
Bonds?

00:14:11.290 --> 00:14:14.330
The Sekirei core... is shining?

00:14:15.540 --> 00:14:17.170
Musubi...chan?

00:14:18.120 --> 00:14:21.170
Believe in each other, and it will bring forth power.

00:14:21.170 --> 00:14:26.140
If you have a true bond between you, then there is nothing to be afraid of.

00:14:31.250 --> 00:14:32.440
Minato-san...

00:14:32.840 --> 00:14:34.850
Are you... Musubi-chan?

00:14:35.710 --> 00:14:37.550
Please give me...

00:14:38.470 --> 00:14:39.150
...your power.

00:14:51.860 --> 00:14:52.660
A Norito...

00:14:53.360 --> 00:14:57.840
The fist of my contract,
destroy the calamity that befalls my Ashikabi.

00:15:09.440 --> 00:15:10.850
I'm happy...

00:15:10.850 --> 00:15:12.270
MUSUBI!

00:15:24.860 --> 00:15:28.430
To be able to become this strong...

00:15:30.830 --> 00:15:32.250
The effect of Norito...

00:15:34.440 --> 00:15:36.920
The power is wearing off...

00:15:39.170 --> 00:15:40.250
Musubi-chan!

00:16:02.320 --> 00:16:04.230
G-Guys!

00:16:06.280 --> 00:16:08.700
Do not take our bond lightly!

00:16:09.070 --> 00:16:11.530
Don't bully Onii-chan and Muu-chan!

00:16:12.280 --> 00:16:14.580
You can barely even stand.

00:16:14.580 --> 00:16:16.230
I wonder about that...

00:16:16.230 --> 00:16:17.000
What do you think, Matsu?

00:16:17.370 --> 00:16:19.430
According to my calculations,

00:16:19.430 --> 00:16:24.040
if we all attack at once, ending it in a draw is possible.

00:16:38.200 --> 00:16:39.760
I'm going back for now.

00:16:40.950 --> 00:16:44.170
Entertain me even more next time.

00:17:01.510 --> 00:17:03.090
Well done, Musubi.

00:17:03.090 --> 00:17:04.420
T-Tsukiumi.

00:17:04.420 --> 00:17:06.960
Yes, I've done my best.

00:17:09.340 --> 00:17:11.390
Putting that aside...

00:17:12.050 --> 00:17:15.540
Minato, how long are you going to hug her?!

00:17:15.540 --> 00:17:18.850
You really are the best man around!

00:17:18.850 --> 00:17:21.640
Hey! Who said you are allowed to do that?!

00:17:22.680 --> 00:17:25.490
All's well that ends well, I guess?

00:17:25.490 --> 00:17:30.100
Well, we got what we came for, so I guess it's fine.

00:17:31.160 --> 00:17:32.110
Onii-chan!

00:17:32.110 --> 00:17:33.160
Kuu-chan.

00:17:34.020 --> 00:17:36.830
Will Chiho Onee-chan be able to walk now?

00:17:37.870 --> 00:17:39.580
Yup, definitely.

00:17:41.890 --> 00:17:42.750
Uzume-san,

00:17:43.680 --> 00:17:46.050
it seems like I'll be able to keep my promise.

00:17:57.110 --> 00:17:59.100
Be careful with the rubble!

00:17:59.650 --> 00:18:01.990
M.B.I. puts safety first!

00:18:01.990 --> 00:18:06.270
Although the reason for Capital Tower's collapse is still a mystery,

00:18:06.270 --> 00:18:10.240
M.B.I.'s staff is carrying out repairs as fast as possible.

00:18:15.700 --> 00:18:16.580
See?

00:18:16.580 --> 00:18:20.040
I am able to walk now.

00:18:20.920 --> 00:18:25.960
You'd be surprised to see me this well...

00:18:27.090 --> 00:18:32.550
Let's go see the sea, the mountains,
and even the endless sky together someday.

00:18:33.550 --> 00:18:36.390
I'll be waiting for you, Uzume-chan.

00:18:36.910 --> 00:18:37.980
Forever.

00:18:49.190 --> 00:18:51.960
The destruction of the tower triggered the Third Stage.

00:18:51.960 --> 00:18:54.110
If so, the Jinki...

00:18:54.630 --> 00:18:56.000
Minaka will use this...

00:18:56.490 --> 00:18:57.530
Matsu-san.

00:19:00.290 --> 00:19:01.580
M-Mina-tan!

00:19:03.320 --> 00:19:05.080
Are your wounds okay?

00:19:05.080 --> 00:19:08.360
Th-This is nothing for me!

00:19:11.600 --> 00:19:13.630
Matsu-san, where's Minaka...?

00:19:15.050 --> 00:19:17.600
He's floating around in satellite orbit.

00:19:18.040 --> 00:19:22.770
When I found out about his escape pod, I made some minor adjustments to it.

00:19:23.690 --> 00:19:25.690
Let's see now... Where am I?

00:19:25.690 --> 00:19:29.610
Well, he won't die just with that.

00:19:35.530 --> 00:19:39.840
Hey! Isn't there anyone out there who's trying to escape?

00:19:39.840 --> 00:19:42.450
President... missing...

00:19:42.870 --> 00:19:47.250
Disciplinary Squad... on hold...

00:19:47.250 --> 00:19:50.920
If I relax around here like this, I'll get rusty.

00:19:51.390 --> 00:19:55.590
You'll have to endure this until the new Capital Tower is built.

00:19:56.090 --> 00:19:58.010
It's not that, Natsuo.

00:19:58.010 --> 00:20:02.970
I'll be happy living with you, be it in a tower, or an apartment,

00:20:02.970 --> 00:20:05.140
or even a cardboard house.

00:20:06.720 --> 00:20:07.890
Hey, Karasuba...

00:20:08.390 --> 00:20:11.360
Should we tell them to make a new one?

00:20:15.840 --> 00:20:18.740
Aww, this sucks.

00:20:19.170 --> 00:20:22.330
I wish they'd do another event like that.

00:20:22.330 --> 00:20:25.750
Hey, what do you think that "amazing treasure" was?

00:20:28.440 --> 00:20:29.110
Sheesh.

00:20:29.940 --> 00:20:32.840
Hey, Master... is this the end?

00:20:32.840 --> 00:20:34.670
Like hell it's the end!

00:20:34.670 --> 00:20:36.610
We can still play around?

00:20:36.610 --> 00:20:38.090
You bet!

00:20:38.090 --> 00:20:40.960
It's our turn to roll now!

00:20:40.960 --> 00:20:43.140
Master, you're so cool!

00:20:44.490 --> 00:20:49.310
We've finally finished analyzing the data we hacked from M.B.I.

00:20:49.310 --> 00:20:50.480
Good work.

00:20:57.310 --> 00:20:59.940
Hey, was that okay?

00:21:00.820 --> 00:21:02.670
Give Higa fake data?

00:21:02.670 --> 00:21:05.280
Yeah. You can do it, can't you?

00:21:06.100 --> 00:21:08.850
I bet Higa's really pissed off right now.

00:21:08.850 --> 00:21:11.280
Who cares? Just the contract fee is enough to make me rich!

00:21:11.640 --> 00:21:16.480
All right! I'll go get some drinks with some babes for the first time in a while.

00:21:19.850 --> 00:21:24.310
It seems like the number of Sekirei dropped by a lot in that commotion.

00:21:24.310 --> 00:21:26.560
I wonder if Kuu-chan is all right?

00:21:29.580 --> 00:21:32.570
Kuu is doing fine, somewhere in this Capital.

00:21:33.020 --> 00:21:35.440
I can tell that much.

00:21:36.810 --> 00:21:38.330
Here you go, Kuu-chan.

00:21:39.360 --> 00:21:40.770
It doesn't hurt anymore, right?

00:21:41.930 --> 00:21:43.120
Next is...

00:21:44.040 --> 00:21:45.240
It's a lot better now, eh?

00:21:45.640 --> 00:21:48.390
It's all thanks to your care, Minato-san.

00:21:48.390 --> 00:21:49.580
Minato!

00:21:49.580 --> 00:21:50.210
Yes?!

00:21:50.210 --> 00:21:53.460
M-Me too, my knee still hurts.

00:21:53.460 --> 00:21:55.740
Ah, okay. Wait!

00:21:55.740 --> 00:22:00.130
Minato-kun! My breast hurts around here.

00:22:00.130 --> 00:22:01.640
C-Coming!

00:22:02.560 --> 00:22:05.550
Ah, it's more this way.

00:22:06.130 --> 00:22:08.570
W-What are you doing?!

00:22:08.570 --> 00:22:10.390
It's swollen here.

00:22:11.540 --> 00:22:12.850
Look at that...

00:22:12.850 --> 00:22:18.280
Gosh, Kazehana... Would you like a more serious injury than that?

00:22:18.280 --> 00:22:19.940
M-More?

00:22:19.940 --> 00:22:22.610
A joke! It's just a joke!

00:22:24.090 --> 00:22:25.810
Just like an afternoon melodrama.

00:22:26.110 --> 00:22:28.910
I'm sorry Miya, causing you trouble again.

00:22:28.910 --> 00:22:31.730
You guys are so helpless.

00:22:33.490 --> 00:22:39.040
I think Sekirei are beings with an endless amount of possibilities.

00:22:40.250 --> 00:22:45.500
The source of that power being the bond between the Sekirei and Ashikabi.

00:22:45.500 --> 00:22:46.300
Bond...

00:22:47.490 --> 00:22:51.420
What I want is for you to discover that for yourself.

00:22:54.090 --> 00:22:57.230
Now, it's almost lunch time.

00:22:57.380 --> 00:22:58.920
Okay!

00:22:59.620 --> 00:23:01.500
That was close, too close.

00:23:01.500 --> 00:23:03.820
I thought I might have died there.

00:23:05.850 --> 00:23:08.370
The course corrections are perfect.

00:23:08.370 --> 00:23:11.710
In the end, nobody managed to get their hands on that.

00:23:12.560 --> 00:23:16.000
It means that the game is far from over yet.

00:23:16.410 --> 00:23:21.010
Now, I must return. To my capital, Shin-Touteitou.

00:23:21.790 --> 00:23:24.760
I must prepare for the next stage.

00:23:25.530 --> 00:23:28.430
Be sure to wait keenly!
